cosmos3-blocksv12-fd

Training code for Cosmos3-Nano forward dynamics on the Blocks V12 four-task dataset.

cosmos_framework/configs/base/experiment/action/posttrain_config/action_fd_blocksv12_posttrain.py is derived
from action_fd_droid_posttrain.py in NVIDIA's cosmos-framework (https://github.com/NVIDIA/cosmos-framework,
commit 5e67049), distributed under the OpenMDW License Agreement 1.1 (SPDX: OpenMDW-1.1),
Copyright (c) 2026 NVIDIA CORPORATION & AFFILIATES. That file keeps NVIDIA's notice.
patches/apply_overlay.py quotes a few anchor lines of the same framework in order to locate its hooks.
The remaining files are original and are released under the Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The ReRoPE operator follows "Repurposing RoPE for Relative Camera Control" (arXiv 2602.08068) and the PRoPE
operator (arXiv 2507.10496).
